Pentagram Room
The Wizard of Frobozz is here, eyeing you warily.
There is a demon floating in midair here.

>give bills to demon
"Most fine, master! But 'tis not enough. I will do a great service, and are not
great services bought at great price?"

>give portrait to demon
"Very nice, but not enough!"

>give crown to demon
"Ah, truly magnificent! Keep them coming."

>give stamp to demon
"Almost halfway there, oh worthy one!"

>give zorkmid to demon
"Oh, such beauty! Your generosity almost overwhelms me!"

>give statuette to demon
"Truly I shall do thee a wonderful service when thou hast finished!"

>give necklace to demon
"Truly you are most generous! But still, this is yet not enough."

>give ruby to demon
"A fine gift, mighty one, you have almost reached my fee."
The Wizard looks at you as if you are a madman. He tears his beard and stares at
you fearfully.

